    <string translatable="false" name="focus_guard_detail">Enable Focus Launcher in Accessibility settings. The service checks the foreground app name and returns you home when a blocked app opens. Phone calls, the keyboard and system settings stay available. It does not close app processes. You can turn it off at any time.</string>
