    <string translatable="false" name="wallpaper_earth">Earth · daily satellite view</string>
    <string translatable="false" name="wallpaper_earth_detail">Earth mode downloads a small NASA Blue Marble mosaic crop, then keeps it for day and night. A new date picks a new location. This is historical satellite imagery. Offline, you get a generated landscape until the download succeeds. Imagery: NASA / GSFC / Reto Stöckli.</string>
    <string translatable="false" name="focus_service_description">Locks the screen on double tap. During a focus timer, checks foreground app names and returns home when a blocked app opens. Phone calls, the keyboard and Settings remain available.</string>
    <string translatable="false" name="focus_close_apps">Close locked apps on start</string>
    <string translatable="false" name="focus_close_apps_detail">Android needs Shizuku access to force-stop other apps. Set up and start Shizuku, then authorize Focus Launcher. This closes the locked apps; it can interrupt their downloads and delay their notifications until you open them again. Phone, SMS, clock/alarms, the keyboard and Settings are never closed. This option is off by default.</string>
